<title>KUWAIT: New Kuwait industry body holds first meeting.</title>
<headline>New Kuwait industry body holds first meeting.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait's Public Industry Authority held its first meeting on Monday to discuss how it would proceed to oversee the development of industry to help diversify the economy from oil.</p>
<p>&quot;The Authority is ambitious but it needs a year to start working,&quot; the director, Trade and Industry Minister Jassem al-Mudaf, told a news conference.</p>
<p>The body was formed earlier this month to promote local industry.</p>
</text>
